1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,417
It's raining.

2
00:00:03,967 --> 00:00:05,225
Lily has a plan.

3
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:07,427
A very productive plan.

4
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:11,145
Lily: Today, I will finally become a better person!

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,183
Page one.

6
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,549
Fifteen photos.

7
00:00:30,599 --> 00:00:32,274
Zero pages after that.

8
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:52,508
Lily: I'm doing… the relaxing position.

9
00:00:52,538 --> 00:00:55,287
The relaxing position lasted two hours.

10
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:13,300
Mom: You said you'd clean.

11
00:01:13,170 --> 00:01:14,489
Mom: It looks worse.

12
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:16,654
Lily: It's… a process, Mom.

13
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,927
Rain makes everything taste better.

14
00:01:35,377 --> 00:01:37,204
Especially instant noodles.

15
00:01:38,654 --> 00:01:40,880
And the second pack of instant noodles.

16
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:51,832
Max: The rain stopped!

17
00:01:51,702 --> 00:01:52,681
Max: Let's go out!

18
00:01:52,711 --> 00:01:54,482
Lily: …I think it might rain again.

19
00:02:04,633 --> 00:02:06,525
Plans completed: none.

20
00:02:07,475 --> 00:02:11,213
But sometimes, a rainy day isn't for being productive.

21
00:02:12,163 --> 00:02:13,279
It's for resting.

22
00:02:14,229 --> 00:02:15,246
And noodles.

23
00:02:16,356 --> 00:02:17,336
Lily: Tomorrow.

24
00:02:17,206 --> 00:02:19,216
Lily: I'll be a better person tomorrow.
